        ],
        "en": [
          "Located near the largest permanent circus in France, La Coupole will seduce you with its Parisian bistro spirit.\n\nThe restaurant offers you a menu made with fresh products, imagined according to the seasons and regularly renewed.\n\nIf you are a lover of good wines, accompany your board with a good glass."
        ],
        "it": [
